{"name":"Mr & Mrs Bund","name_en":"Mr & Mrs Bund by Paul Pairet","district":"黄浦区","address":"黄浦区中山东一路18号外滩18号6楼","price_avg":988,"price_range":"¥988/位(2025晚餐套餐)","signature_dishes":["主厨独创柠檬塔","松露原味面包","柑橘罐蒸大虾","袋蒸黑鳕鱼","酱烧牛小肋排"],"cuisine_paths":[["西餐","法餐"]],"form":"Finedining","status":"open","awards":{"michelin":"入选","black_pearl":1,"source_url":"https://www.enprimeurclub.com/lists/2026-black-pearl-1-diamond"},"phone_raw":null,"booking_method":"电话/大众点评","evidence":{"diner_quotes":[{"quote":"炭烤章鱼肉质很嫩又带点嚼劲，蘸点类似没奶兹的酱，又烤的特别香了。乡村肉派馅饼是他家招牌。","source":"抖音","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7215967933506309411","date":"2023-03-29"},{"quote":"他家这个排名第一的主厨独创柠檬塔，圈内久负盛名，基本上来餐厅吃过的都会点这一道。每一只都是厨师亲手挖出来的。","source":"抖音","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/6902449625924504832","date":"2020-12-05"}],"platform_scores":[{"platform":"Trip.com","score":4.5,"review_count":500,"url":"https://www.trip.com/travel-guide/foods/shanghai-2-restaurant/mr-and-mrs-bund-by-paul-pairet-484369"}],"negative_signals":["新菜单人均从800涨到1500，性价比争议","乡村肉派部分食客不适应冷食"],"traffic_signals":["外滩地标位","Paul Pairet主理","多年黑珍珠"]},"sources":[{"title":"Mr & Mrs Bund官网菜单","url":"https://www.mmbund.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2025/01/MMB-MENU-DINNER-2025-JAN-R.pdf","type":"brand_official"},{"title":"Trip.com餐厅页","url":"https://www.trip.com/travel-guide/foods/shanghai-2-restaurant/mr-and-mrs-bund-by-paul-pairet-484369","type":"platform"},{"title":"黑珍珠1-diamond名单","url":"https://www.enprimeurclub.com/lists/2026-black-pearl-1-diamond","type":"official_guide"}],"scores":{"objective":75,"diner":72,"taste":82,"endorsement":85,"soft_ad_penalty":0,"platform_credibility":0.85},"data_updated_at":"2026-09-24","notes":"Paul Pairet旗下; Ultraviolet同门; 黑珍珠多年一钻"}

{"name":"Stone Sal 言盐西餐厅(东湖路店)","name_en":"Stone Sal Restaurant and Bar","district":"徐汇区","address":"徐汇区东湖路9号上海地产大厦裙房1M号","price_avg":800,"price_range":"¥800-1200/人","signature_dishes":["干式熟成战斧牛排","海胆拌饭(STONESAL Rice)","安格斯牛排","法意烤鸡"],"cuisine_paths":[["西餐","美式牛排"]],"form":"Finedining","status":"open","awards":{"michelin":"无","black_pearl":1,"source_url":"https://www.shobserver.cn/sgh/detail?id=1706837"},"phone_raw":"021-54651765","booking_method":"大众点评/电话","evidence":{"diner_quotes":[{"quote":"接下来这道是到店必点的灵魂海胆拌饭，它用了牛油和黑松露一起炒制。看着这个闪着牛油光辉的饭，一粒粒就晶莹饱满，清香扑鼻。","source":"抖音","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/6900646902107327759","date":"2020-11-30"},{"quote":"他们家的招牌干式熟成牛排简直绝绝子！推荐五分熟，外层焦香四溢，切开后内里肉汁饱满，配上秘制海盐口感层次超丰富！","source":"携程","url":"https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=157805740","date":"2025-06-08"}],"platform_scores":[{"platform":"Trip.com","score":4.7,"review_count":200,"url":"https://hk.trip.com/moments/poi-stonesal-44217097/"}],"negative_signals":["有食客吐槽四成熟推荐奇怪","off menu菜不解释做法","服务评分3.2分(有嘉宾反馈)"],"traffic_signals":["干式熟成牛排陈列柜","地下停车电梯直通","黑珍珠牛排天花板口碑"]},"sources":[{"title":"上观新闻徐汇黑珍珠名单","url":"https://www.shobserver.cn/sgh/detail?id=1706837","type":"official_guide"},{"title":"DiningCity餐厅页","url":"https://www.diningcity.cn/zh-HK/shanghai/stonesal_shanghai","type":"platform"},{"title":"名厨Chef Ling专访","url":"https://m.greatchef.com.cn/index/newsview?id=8892","type":"media"}],"scores":{"objective":72,"diner":75,"taste":80,"endorsement":78,"soft_ad_penalty":3,"platform_credibility":0.85},"data_updated_at":"2026-09-24","notes":"Chef Ling主理; 2017年开业; 现代美式牛排馆"}

{"name":"The Pine 松涧","name_en":"The Pine","district":"徐汇区","address":"徐汇区长乐路333号花园洋房","price_avg":1436,"price_range":"午市¥1000/晚市¥1698+10%","signature_dishes":["梅干菜惠灵顿牛排","东星斑酸菜泡饭","不烂子松叶蟹","鸽子胸肉","黄酒醉三黄鸡"],"cuisine_paths":[["西餐","融合菜","中式法餐"]],"form":"Finedining","status":"open","awards":{"michelin":"一星","black_pearl":1,"source_url":"https://www.shobserver.cn/sgh/detail?id=1706837"},"phone_raw":null,"booking_method":"电话/大众点评","evidence":{"diner_quotes":[{"quote":"主食鱼肉饭，炸米配上浓浓的高汤做的泡饭，搅在一起那个口感是本场第2名，复合味道到现在都无法忘记。第一名是不烂子以及松叶蟹腿肉。","source":"抖音","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7631119060600786338","date":"2026-04-21"},{"quote":"M7和牛眼肉盖，干烧牛筋炖得软而不烂，吃起来弹牙而入味。东星斑酸菜泡饭配脆米，把中餐特色融入西餐。","source":"携程","url":"https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=221011484","date":"2025-10-31"}],"platform_scores":[{"platform":"Trip.com","score":4.6,"review_count":100,"url":"https://you.ctrip.com/food/shanghai2/21354273-dianping-p2.html"}],"negative_signals":["人均高","套餐制不灵活"],"traffic_signals":["花园洋房艺术空间","宋韵主题","米其林一星"]},"sources":[{"title":"上观新闻徐汇黑珍珠名单","url":"https://www.shobserver.cn/sgh/detail?id=1706837","type":"official_guide"},{"title":"TARGET致品网迁址报道","url":"http://lifestyle.luxtarget.com/Column/20230605/28893.html","type":"media"},{"title":"DiningCity餐厅页","url":"https://www.diningcity.cn/zh-HK/shanghai/the_pine_at_ruijin_shanghai","type":"platform"}],"scores":{"objective":78,"diner":76,"taste":85,"endorsement":88,"soft_ad_penalty":0,"platform_credibility":0.9},"data_updated_at":"2026-09-24","notes":"创始人田熠菲、刘雯超; 2023年迁址长乐路333号; 中式法餐开创者"}

