{"name":"福廬 FULL HOUSE","name_en":"Full House","district":"静安区","address":"静安区南京西路688广场L106A","price_avg":1680,"price_range":"¥1500-1800/人","signature_dishes":["梁溪脆鳝","蟹粉翅","川味葵花鸡","鱼子酱空心饼","清炖狮子头"],"cuisine_paths":[["中餐","淮扬菜"],["中餐","川菜"]],"form":"Finedining","status":"open","awards":{"michelin":"无","black_pearl":1,"source_url":"https://www.jfdaily.com/sgh/detail?id=1701936"},"phone_raw":"021-62290881","booking_method":"电话/大众点评","evidence":{"diner_quotes":[{"quote":"福庐咸鸡肉质紧实，咸香入味，青麻爽芹清爽带点柔和麻香。清炖狮子头炖得软烂，汤底清润鲜而不腻。招牌菊花鱼造型精致，外皮酥脆内里嫩。","source":"抖音","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7658890172184291747","date":"2026-07-05"},{"quote":"食庐常往而福庐不常往，位置很好北京路凯宾斯基隔壁，餐厅小巧精致总共才三个包间，装潢经典耐看。当日选经典菜单足足二十几道。","source":"携程","url":"https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=80282056","date":"2024-09-08"}],"platform_scores":[{"platform":"Trip.com","score":4.8,"review_count":50,"url":"https://hk.trip.com/restaurant/china/shanghai/detail/full-house-141043833/"}],"negative_signals":["仅三个包间难订","人均高"],"traffic_signals":["食庐集团高端线","新荣记朱俊团队","2026新上榜黑珍珠"]},"sources":[{"title":"上观新闻静安黑珍珠名单","url":"https://www.jfdaily.com/sgh/detail?id=1701936","type":"official_guide"},{"title":"携程餐厅页","url":"https://you.ctrip.com/food/shanghai2/141043833.html","type":"platform"},{"title":"搜狐美食探店","url":"https://m.sohu.com/a/692168458_304784/","type":"media"}],"scores":{"objective":74,"diner":76,"taste":82,"endorsement":80,"soft_ad_penalty":0,"platform_credibility":0.85},"data_updated_at":"2026-09-24","notes":"食庐集团(朱俊)旗下高端品牌; 川扬合味; 2026新上榜"}

{"name":"随堂里","name_en":"Sui Tang Li","district":"静安区","address":"静安区石门一路366号镛舍公寓式酒店2层","price_avg":600,"price_range":"¥600-900/人","signature_dishes":["5J火腿小笼包","鹅肝酱配葱油饼","宝塔东坡肉","青酱笋壳鱼","流沙随堂包"],"cuisine_paths":[["中餐","苏浙菜","本帮融合"]],"form":"Finedining","status":"open","awards":{"michelin":"入选","black_pearl":1,"source_url":"https://www.trip.com/moments/poi-sui-tang-li-56741907/"},"phone_raw":null,"booking_method":"酒店预订/大众点评","evidence":{"diner_quotes":[{"quote":"5J火腿小笼包，汤汁饱满，5J火腿吊足了咸鲜味，油润却不腻。鹅肝酱配葱油饼是店里招牌第一名，口感酥脆，鹅肝酱上的花生碎味道格外抢镜。","source":"抖音","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7199629767413402939","date":"2023-02-16"},{"quote":"葱油饼配鹅肝酱，鹅肝酱浓郁，葱油饼脆香，组合效果好有创意。点心218一份就三个小笼，一个鲜肉一个虾仁一个蔬菜。","source":"携程","url":"https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=236367559","date":"2025-12-04"}],"platform_scores":[{"platform":"Trip.com","score":4.6,"review_count":200,"url":"https://www.trip.com/moments/poi-sui-tang-li-56741907/"}],"negative_signals":["点心价格偏贵","有食客认为菊花豆腐汤太淡无鲜"],"traffic_signals":["镛舍酒店内","连续7年黑珍珠一钻","商务约会场景"]},"sources":[{"title":"Trip.com餐厅页","url":"https://www.trip.com/moments/poi-sui-tang-li-56741907/","type":"platform"},{"title":"携程黑珍珠打卡笔记","url":"https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=283240000","type":"ugc"},{"title":"上观新闻静安黑珍珠名单","url":"https://www.jfdaily.com/sgh/detail?id=1701936","type":"official_guide"}],"scores":{"objective":75,"diner":74,"taste":78,"endorsement":82,"soft_ad_penalty":0,"platform_credibility":0.9},"data_updated_at":"2026-09-24","notes":"The Middle House镛舍酒店中餐厅; 新派苏浙菜"}

