{"name":"徽季","name_en":"Hui Ji","brand_group":"新荣记集团","brand_confirmed":true,"district":"浦东新区","address":"浦东新区世纪大道1788号陆家嘴金控广场V2号别墅","price_avg":600,"price_range":"¥500-800/人","signature_dishes":["刀板香火腿蒸溪鳗","肥肠卤古镇香干","石耳土鸡炖石蛙汤","泡椒花菜梗"],"cuisine_paths":[["中餐","徽菜"]],"form":"Finedining","status":"open","awards":{"michelin":"入选","black_pearl":1,"source_url":"https://mobile.epaper.routeryun.com/index.php/home/article/index/appkey/41/date/2026-01-29/aid/9200346.html"},"phone_raw":null,"booking_method":"微信预订/大众点评","evidence":{"diner_quotes":[{"quote":"刀板香火腿蒸溪鳗印象很深，溪鳗软糯，油脂刚刚好，取刀板香的咸香。徽季是新荣记在浦东陆家嘴的最新品牌，独栋别墅。","source":"携程","url":"https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=92050673","date":"2024-10-19"},{"quote":"泡椒花菜梗是新荣记的招牌之一，很多店模仿都超越不了。花菜梗口感生脆，有泡菜的酸辣，非常开胃。","source":"抖音","url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7510944031111662863","date":"2025-06-01"}],"platform_scores":[{"platform":"携程","score":4.5,"review_count":50,"url":"https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=158584077"}],"negative_signals":["部分菜表达太克制婉约","需微信安排菜单"],"traffic_signals":["新荣记集团首间徽菜","独栋别墅","2026新上榜黑珍珠"]},"sources":[{"title":"米其林指南","url":"https://guide.michelin.com/sg/zh_CN/shanghai-municipality/shanghai/restaurant/hui-ji","type":"official_guide"},{"title":"浦东时报黑珍珠名单","url":"https://mobile.epaper.routeryun.com/index.php/home/article/index/appkey/41/date/2026-01-29/aid/9200346.html","type":"media"}],"scores":{"objective":76,"diner":74,"taste":80,"endorsement":85,"soft_ad_penalty":0,"platform_credibility":0.9},"data_updated_at":"2026-09-24","notes":"新荣记集团旗下首间徽菜; 与品粹1788合作"}

